;; Rank 4: kmet1's three modes (`print`, `rpc`, `rpc-client`) and its entry and
;; process shims. The TUI, its interactive cluster and the config command left
;; for `ui` at 5l-iii; what remains is what retirement deletes.
;;
;; The bundled extension libraries (cljfmt, rewrite-clj, parinferish, edamame,
;; spec.alpha, tools.reader) and the SCI pin are `app`'s since 4b-ii-b moved the
;; host's leaves (the evaluation contexts and the bundled library set) and the
;; loop's two stages there; `kmet/loader` left with the host itself, whose only
;; src user it was. They stay on this module's classpath transitively;
;; kmet.test-module-deps holds each module's declarations to its src's requires.
{:paths ["src" "test"]
 :deps {kmet/ui   {:local/root "../ui"}
        kmet/libs {:local/root "../libs"}
        kmet/ai   {:local/root "../ai"}
        kmet/srce {:local/root "../srce"}
        kmet/app  {:local/root "../app"}
        babashka/process {:mvn/version "0.6.25"}}}
